  "voice": {
    "post_text": [
      "Looking for an easy way to impress your guests this summer? Drop an Orange Cream Pop into a glass of champagne, top it with a splash of orange juice, and you’ve got the ultimate Pop Mimosa. It’s the perfect addition to brunches, pool parties, or your next backyard gathering. \nThe best part? Our Orange Cream Pops are back in stock in our online store! Made with fresh @Natalie’s Orange Juice, they’re bursting with bright citrus flavor and creamy nostalgia the perfect pop for sipping, snacking, or turning into your new favorite summer cocktail.  \nWe have a 12 POP mix & match minimum, and we offer FREE shipping on 24 POPS or more anywhere in the continentals US! 🇺🇸",
